      "text": "M.   y   n    a.   m   e   is A nurag Negi\n77 121 32 110 97 109 101 32 105 115 32 65 110 117 114 97 103 32 78 101 103 105\n\n\n5F 52 09 54\n55 52 08 54\n8 bit = 1 byte\n0101 1111      01010010   00001001  0101 0100  01010101  0101010101.........\n0101 0101      01010010   00001000 0101 0100  01010101  0101010101.......\n+\n10101010000001001010101010101010101010101010101010101\n\n\nmainframe - switches",
